+// VRAM is moved whole rather than to VRAM_Size, because the array is whole
+// and the addressing masks make the tail unreachable either way. The tile
+// cache is not moved at all: it is derived from VRAM, and a model that
+// carried it could restore a cache that disagreed with its own memory.
